<title>USA: Stanley Works CFO Richard Huck to retire.</title>
<headline>Stanley Works CFO Richard Huck to retire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stanley Works on Wednesday said Chief Financial Officer Richard Huck will retire June 1.</p>
<p>Theresa Yerkes, vice president and controller, will function as CFO until a successor to Huck is identified, the company said.</p>
<p>The Stanley Works produces tools, hardware and specialty hardware for consumer, home improvement, industrial and professional use.</p>
